    "norm": "Verifies {@link LongestCommonSubsequence#longestCommonSubstringLengthArray(CharSequence, CharSequence)}, the dynamic-programming (DP) table builder used by the LCS algorithm. <p>The DP table has {@code left.length() + 1} rows and {@code right.length() + 1} columns. Cell {@code [i][j]} holds the length of the longest common subsequence of the first {@code i} characters of {@code left} and the first {@code j} characters of {@code right}. Row 0 and column 0 act as the empty-prefix base cases and are therefore all zeros.</p>"
